===Etymology 1===
From {{m|es|cuchar}}, from {{inh|es|la|cochlear|cochleārium}} (with an unusual development of /-kl-/), from {{m|la|cochlea}}. Compare {{cog|pt|colher}}, {{cog|ca|cullera}}, {{cog|fr|cuillère}}, {{cog|it|cucchiaio}}, {{cog|scn|cucchiara}}.

